{
  "id": "cafe",
  "name": "Cafe: collect income, invite, tap students",
  "order": 10,
  "after": [],
  "status": "wip",
  "needs_ocr": true,
  "notes": [
    "Run order (owner): cafe, schedule, circle, free package, shop, bounty, commissions, scrimmage, event, missions, tactical challenge, mail, daily missions. 'order' fixes it without blocking.",
    "Cafe income includes AP (646/740 seen on 2026-11-02); one claim covers both cafes.",
    "Only owned students can be touched, and only those show the marker: three yellow strokes at the left of the head. The marker animates, so it is found by colour (click_color). The touch area is the head.",
    "The cafe is larger than the screen: the view is zoomed out first with the mouse wheel (5 notches reach the limit, the markers keep their size; emulators have no wheel and skip it), then dragged to the four corners, and each view is searched.",
    "Invitation: the ticket opens a list of owned students (MomoTalk). The configured names are searched with OCR while scrolling; the first one found is invited. A student that is not owned is not listed and is skipped. A student visiting the other cafe (marked with that cafe in the list) asks twice to be brought over, and another version of a visiting student asks to replace it: all are confirmed, so the configured student is invited.",
    "A ticket on cooldown shows a timer instead of 'available' and is not used.",
    "The bottom-left buttons (edit mode, store all) must never be clicked: taps stay above y = 600 and right of the left buttons."
  ],
  "settings": [
    { "key": "tap_students", "type": "bool", "default": true, "description": "Tap students that have a yellow mark." },
    { "key": "second_cafe", "type": "bool", "default": true, "description": "Also visit the second cafe." },
    { "key": "invite", "type": "bool", "default": true, "description": "Use the invitation ticket of each cafe." },
    {
      "key": "invite_first",
      "type": "list",
      "default": [],
      "description": "Students to invite to the first cafe, in order of preference (names as shown in the game)."
    },
    { "key": "invite_second", "type": "list", "default": [], "description": "Students to invite to the second cafe, in order of preference." }
  ],
